WEBVTT

00:00:05.824 --> 00:00:06.783
[woman gasps]

00:00:06.825 --> 00:00:07.784
Oh.

00:00:07.826 --> 00:00:10.161
Coochie, coochie coo!

00:00:12.122 --> 00:00:13.205
[screams] [snorts]

00:00:13.247 --> 00:00:13.999
[screams]

00:00:14.040 --> 00:00:16.918
[chittering] [screams]

00:00:16.960 --> 00:00:18.210
[animals laughing]

00:00:18.252 --> 00:00:20.379
[Snowball gasps] [Max barking]

00:00:23.424 --> 00:00:24.926
Tiny Dog!

00:00:25.718 --> 00:00:26.928
SNOWBALL: Ya!

00:00:26.970 --> 00:00:28.805
Ah, are you kidding me?

00:00:28.847 --> 00:00:31.766
You thought this was over, Tiny Dog?

00:00:31.808 --> 00:00:33.559
Ya, ya, ya!

00:00:33.601 --> 00:00:34.560
[Max sighs]

00:00:34.602 --> 00:00:36.228
[tires screech]

00:00:36.270 --> 00:00:37.605
[screams]

00:00:37.647 --> 00:00:39.315
Huh?

00:00:42.068 --> 00:00:44.112
[yells] Jab, jab, jab!

00:00:44.154 --> 00:00:45.237
Body blow! Body blow!

00:00:45.279 --> 00:00:46.364
Karate chop to your neck!

00:00:46.405 --> 00:00:47.740
[chattering wildly] Would you...

00:00:47.782 --> 00:00:49.909
Would... would you get off me?

00:00:49.951 --> 00:00:51.202
[Tattoo squealing]

00:00:51.995 --> 00:00:53.955
SNOWBALL: Tattoo!

00:00:53.997 --> 00:00:55.206
[doors closing]

00:00:55.247 --> 00:00:59.169
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:01:03.089 --> 00:01:07.010
Oh, TD, this kills me to say,

00:01:07.052 --> 00:01:09.888
but we got to join forces, man.

00:01:09.929 --> 00:01:12.182
♪ No sleep till ♪

00:01:15.560 --> 00:01:17.603
♪ Brooklyn... ♪

00:01:19.647 --> 00:01:21.107
Whoo!

00:01:21.149 --> 00:01:23.609
Ha! We make a great team, Tiny Dog!

00:01:23.651 --> 00:01:27.279
Well, mainly, I'm doing all the hard work, but you're helping.

00:01:27.321 --> 00:01:29.281
Yes, yes, fine. Just keep your eyes on the road.

00:01:29.323 --> 00:01:30.909
You're driving like an animal!

00:01:30.950 --> 00:01:32.284
♪ No sleep till... ♪

00:01:32.326 --> 00:01:33.452
Woo-hoo!

00:01:33.494 --> 00:01:34.537
[grunts]

00:01:34.579 --> 00:01:35.538
What was that?

00:01:35.580 --> 00:01:37.289
Oh, that was a pothole.

00:01:37.331 --> 00:01:39.042
You're hitting things on purpose!

00:01:39.084 --> 00:01:41.502
you know me too well, TD. [chuckles] You know,

00:01:41.544 --> 00:01:43.129
Always keeping me in check.

00:01:43.171 --> 00:01:46.424
♪ No sleep till Brooklyn ♪

00:01:46.465 --> 00:01:47.884
[tires screeching] [horns honking]

00:01:47.926 --> 00:01:51.137
♪ No sleep till Brooklyn... ♪

00:01:51.179 --> 00:01:52.430
Do you see the van?

00:01:52.471 --> 00:01:53.765
Yeah, I see it.

00:01:53.806 --> 00:01:55.516
We're about to hit it.

00:01:55.558 --> 00:01:57.227
♪ Till Brooklyn. ♪

00:01:57.268 --> 00:01:58.310
[animals grunting]

00:01:58.352 --> 00:02:00.479
[laughing]

00:02:02.774 --> 00:02:03.900
[tires screeching]

00:02:03.942 --> 00:02:05.443
[both screaming]

00:02:08.654 --> 00:02:10.364
[men screaming]

00:02:14.368 --> 00:02:17.163
[horns honking] [people murmuring]

00:02:19.249 --> 00:02:20.625
[Snowball sighs] [Max grunts]

00:02:20.666 --> 00:02:22.585
Relax, Snowball, I got you.

00:02:22.627 --> 00:02:24.254
There he is! DERICK:

00:02:24.295 --> 00:02:26.297
He's got Snowball.

00:02:26.338 --> 00:02:27.966
[roars]

00:02:28.007 --> 00:02:29.300
[gasps]

00:02:31.302 --> 00:02:33.054
[animals clamoring]

00:02:33.096 --> 00:02:34.889
[people screaming]

00:02:34.931 --> 00:02:36.724
[kids cheering]

00:02:36.766 --> 00:02:38.684
Uh...

00:02:38.726 --> 00:02:41.353
[gasping]

00:02:42.855 --> 00:02:46.400
Look, fellas, this is not what this looks like.

00:02:46.442 --> 00:02:48.653
Shush, you!

00:02:48.694 --> 00:02:51.405
You were gonna eat the boss!

00:02:51.447 --> 00:02:52.573
No, no, no, no, no.

00:02:52.615 --> 00:02:53.950
are on the same side now. Snowball and I

00:02:53.992 --> 00:02:56.202
Snowball, tell them. Dude, tell 'em.

00:02:56.244 --> 00:02:58.621
That raccoon is lying!

00:02:58.663 --> 00:03:00.790
He's not the president.

00:03:00.832 --> 00:03:01.833
ANIMALS: Huh?

00:03:01.874 --> 00:03:03.375
[chuckles] Uh, I-I...

00:03:03.417 --> 00:03:05.377
Uh... [roars]

00:03:05.419 --> 00:03:07.213
Come on, now.

00:03:07.255 --> 00:03:09.381
Come here, you. [hissing]

00:03:09.423 --> 00:03:11.217
[giggles]

00:03:12.760 --> 00:03:14.846
[Gidget yelling]

00:03:14.887 --> 00:03:17.348
[Tiberius screeches]

00:03:18.850 --> 00:03:20.226
Gidget?

00:03:21.019 --> 00:03:23.271
[yelling]

00:03:27.733 --> 00:03:28.860
[whimpers]

00:03:28.901 --> 00:03:31.154
[yelling continues]

00:03:34.991 --> 00:03:36.617
Hi-ya!

00:03:36.659 --> 00:03:38.828
[yelling continues]

00:03:38.870 --> 00:03:40.663
[rapid grunting]

00:03:44.125 --> 00:03:45.584
[yelling continues]

00:03:47.628 --> 00:03:51.382
Hi... ya!

00:03:54.969 --> 00:03:56.637
Go, Max!

00:03:56.679 --> 00:03:58.264
Right. I-I-- Okay, g-got to go.

00:03:58.306 --> 00:03:59.724
Thank you, thank you!

00:03:59.765 --> 00:04:01.059
[groans]

00:04:01.100 --> 00:04:03.186
Stay down!

00:04:03.228 --> 00:04:05.563
[metal groaning]

00:04:05.604 --> 00:04:07.357
[animals scream]

00:04:09.108 --> 00:04:10.442
[grunts]

00:04:13.946 --> 00:04:16.574
Whoa! Whoa!

00:04:16.615 --> 00:04:18.659
Duke, hang on!

00:04:18.701 --> 00:04:20.661
[grunts] Whoa!

00:04:20.703 --> 00:04:22.454
[screams]

00:04:22.496 --> 00:04:24.123
[gasps]

00:04:24.165 --> 00:04:27.085
[grunting]

00:04:27.126 --> 00:04:28.502
[gasps]

00:04:31.089 --> 00:04:32.715
[grunting]

00:04:32.757 --> 00:04:34.092
[glass crackling]

00:04:34.133 --> 00:04:35.467
-Duke! -Max?

00:04:35.509 --> 00:04:36.302
Uh, Max!

00:04:36.344 --> 00:04:37.720
Oh, okay, get the keys!

00:04:37.762 --> 00:04:39.013
-Right! -Hurry!

00:04:39.055 --> 00:04:40.306
Ah!

00:04:45.770 --> 00:04:47.438
[screaming]

00:04:49.648 --> 00:04:51.692
Whoa.

00:04:53.903 --> 00:04:56.155
[grunting]

00:04:57.949 --> 00:04:59.909
[gasps]

00:04:59.951 --> 00:05:01.493
[grunting]

00:05:01.535 --> 00:05:03.662
Whoa!

00:05:08.793 --> 00:05:10.461
[grunting]

00:05:12.171 --> 00:05:14.006
Come on, come on.

00:05:14.048 --> 00:05:15.341
I got 'em!

00:05:15.841 --> 00:05:18.970
[both screaming]

00:05:19.011 --> 00:05:20.430
Max!

00:05:27.728 --> 00:05:29.730
[grunting]

00:05:38.948 --> 00:05:40.825
[gasping]

00:05:42.785 --> 00:05:43.744
[grunting]

00:05:43.786 --> 00:05:44.787
[gasps]

00:05:51.127 --> 00:05:52.962
[animals gasp]

00:05:53.004 --> 00:05:54.546
Mwah!

00:05:54.588 --> 00:05:57.467
Remember me!

00:05:59.802 --> 00:06:02.013
[gasping]

00:06:02.054 --> 00:06:04.265
[coughing]

00:06:07.768 --> 00:06:09.437
[grunts]

